# Optional: accept /tg/webhook only from the networks Telegram publishes for webhook delivery
# (https://core.telegram.org/bots/webhooks, "The short version"). Copy to allow-telegram.conf, rebuild the
# proxy image, and watch the access log for 403 on /tg/webhook: a 403 there means Telegram came from an
# address outside these ranges and updates are being lost. Not active by default; never tried.
allow 149.154.160.0/20;
allow 91.108.4.0/22;
deny all;
